
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>My ScanTag Portfolio</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #eef4ff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      max-width: 350px;
      margin: auto;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #cccccc;
    }

    h1 { color: #2455a4; }

    .tag {
      background: #e0ebff;
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #2455a4;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>My ScanTag</h1>
    <p class="tag">Student Portfolio</p>

    <h3>About My Project</h3>
    <p>Welcome! This is my digital portfolio.</p>

    <h3>My Skills</h3>
    <p>HTML | C Programming | Problem Solving</p>

    <h3>My Project</h3>
    <p>ScanTag - A QR Code Portfolio Product</p>

    <h3>My Goal</h3>
    <p>To learn coding and develop useful products.</p>

    <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/"
       target="_blank">Learn Coding</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
